ains R1 pin 1; /OUT contains R1 pin 2; R1 value 10k"},{"path":"review-work/circuit/experiments/r1_power_calc.out","locator":"P = V^2/R = 0.2304 W; ratio = 2.30x vs 0.1 W limit"},{"path":"review-work/circuit/experiments/r1_clamp.out","locator":"ngspice .op: v(out)=0, i(vclamp)=4.8e-3 A, p_r1 = 2.304e-01 W"},{"path":"review-work/circuit/experiments/NOTES.md","locator":"Calculation and Simulation cross-check sections; tolerance sensitivity note"}],"reasoning":"This is the single criterion the exercise asks to evaluate, and the design fails it by a wide, tolerance-insensitive margin under a condition explicitly stated to persist indefinitely. The passing ERC/DRC results (work/erc/erc.json, work/drc/drc.json) are connectivity/rule checks and carry no information about dissipation, so they do not contradict this finding. Hand calculation and an independent ngspice operating-point simulation agree exactly at 0.2304 W versus the 0.1 W continuous limit, making this an evidence-supported blocking defect rather than a concern."}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1365,"cache_read_input_tokens":71669,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1365},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8473751c-af55-4198-b487-f7f0f2c0b2a8","uuid":"0156a99b-dfa8-41b4-84db-bcb819b8f3f7","timestamp":"2026-10-17T00:39:04.243Z","request_id":"req_011Cg6skesCZo3xpci3bguiz","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_0168DPCQyAXFvJWDoRdtKqk2":{"schema":"agent-ee.review/1","candidate_id":"b965f04e4f7ec2f0a9e09341f18b450848f9a46b51435020c7d62e188f737a1b","run_id":"6348bf9f-798d-40df-abe5-17f5ed5ca84d","packet_sha256":"515d67c39bac865052476abfd5226ccecd114804ffe8769e2da9d3fad4aa5112","role":"circuit","